# Dockerfile uses explicit COPY paths for engine/, api/, and a curated
# subset of experiments/ -- but Docker still uploads the whole build
# context before filtering, so this file keeps that upload small and
# keeps large/irrelevant trees out of it entirely.
#
# Inspected imports before writing this (api/main.py, api/detectors.py,
# api/reconstruct_adapter.py, experiments/m4_2/ml_lattice_detector.py)
# to confirm what's actually required at runtime -- see the Dockerfile
# header comment for the resulting file list.

.git
.github
.claude
.pytest_cache
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.vscode
.idea

# Frontend -- not part of the API image
frontend/
node_modules/
frontend/frontend/node_modules/
frontend/frontend/dist/

# Datasets and evaluation corpora -- not needed at inference time.
# EXCEPTION: kolam19.csv/kolam29.csv ARE needed at inference time --
# api/generation_service.py loads every source pattern in
# split_manifest.json's test split via engine.dataset.load_kolam(), which
# reads these CSVs directly (not just the M5 checkpoint). Found by
# actually running the built image and hitting
# generation_service_available=false in /api/v1/health/ready --
# discovered as a real bug, not assumed away. kolam109.csv (~18MB,
# unused by the test split) stays excluded.
kolam_data/
!kolam_data/Kolam CSV files/
!kolam_data/Kolam CSV files/Kolam CSV files/
!kolam_data/Kolam CSV files/Kolam CSV files/kolam19.csv
!kolam_data/Kolam CSV files/Kolam CSV files/kolam29.csv
real_photos/
synthetic_photos/
synthetic_photos_heldout/
diagnostics/
experiments/m4_1/data/
experiments/m4_2/data/
experiments/m4_1/diagnostics/
experiments/m4_2_generation/

# Training-only / research-only experiment code and artifacts -- not
# imported by api/ (only model.py, ml_lattice_detector.py, peak_detect.py,
# and the __init__.py package markers are, and those are COPY'd
# explicitly in the Dockerfile regardless of this file)
experiments/m4_1/tests/
experiments/m4_2/tests/
experiments/m4_1/results/dot_heatmap_net.pt

# Misc large/irrelevant root-level files
one-stroke-dotted-pulli-kolam.zip
artifacts/
*.md
!README.md

# Secrets / local runtime state -- never present in the image (Dockerfile
# uses explicit COPY paths, not `COPY . .`), but excluded here too so a
# local .env (which may hold real AUTH_SECRET/R2/DATABASE_URL values) or
# accumulated local dev data is never even uploaded to the Docker daemon
# as part of the build context.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
api/storage/artifacts/*.svg
api/storage/artifacts/*.png
api/storage/artifacts/*.json

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
